  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> take values in the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then the probability that the equation <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is satisfied is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math> ( <math><mi>p</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;are co-prime) then, <math><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Total ways is&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Now, <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />If,<br />Case&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />If at least one of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is &ldquo;<math><mn>0</mn></math>&rdquo; i.e. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> ways<br />Case&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />or <math><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />i.e. <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> ways<br />Case&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;ways<br />Hence, required probability<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>81</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
